ning high school dances.\n\n- If Bonnie chaperones high school dances, she cannot be a student who attends the school (from point 3). Therefore, she must be neither a student who attends the school nor very engaged with school events.\n\n- However, if Bonnie is not a student who attends the school, she cannot be inactive and disinterested (from point 4), because inactive and disinterested members must chaperone high school dances (point 4).\n\n- Since Bonnie cannot be inactive and disinterested, she must perform in school talent shows often (from point 1).\n\nTherefore, based on the given information, the statement \"Bonnie performs in school talent shows often\" is true.\n\n</think>\n<answer>\nA) True\n</answer>",
